        "evidence_excerpt": "appealed  to  by  Sheik  Saliui  for  assistance  in  driving \nthe  Spanish  from  the  Penon.  Instead,  he  mnrdered \nthe  sheik,  set  himself  np  in  his  place,  and  soon  had \ncontrol  of  nearly  the  whole  conntry.  In  1518,  while \nretreating  from  an  overwhelming-  Spanish  force,  sent \nagainst  him  from  Oran,  Horuk  was  overtaken  and \nkilled,  desperately  fighting  at  bay.^  The  Spanish \nmight  now  have  seized  Algiers  and  put  an  end  to  its \npiracy  once  for  all,  but  the  opportunity  was  stupidly \nneglected.^",
