        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "\"  On  the  contrary,  it  may  truthfully  be  said \nthat,  while  in  towns  in  which  good  persons \ndwell  good  actions  receive  the  palms  and  the \ncrown,  it  is  among  the  Corsairs  but  to  the \nwicked  to  whom  are  given  recompense  and \npraise.",
