        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "Turbulent,  rash,  unstable  as  water,  were  these \nprimitive  dwellers  of  the  desert ;  but  they  were \nfighters  and  raiders  to  a  man,  and  ready  for  any \ndesperate  encounter  if  only  it  held  out  the  promise \nof  loot :  they  were  as  veritably  the  pirates  of  the \nland  as  were  the  Barbarossas  pirates  of  the  sea.",
