        "evidence_excerpt": "brought  round  under  the  window  of  the  room,  and,  in \nher  night-dress,  with  nothing  but  a  shawl  wrapped \naround  her,  was  Julia -Gonzaga  lowered  out  of  her \nwindow  on  to  the  back  of  her  horse.  As  she  galloped \nfor  dear  life  down  the  avenue  of  her  home  she  heard \nthe  shrieks  of  her  miserable  household  murdered  in \ncold  blood  by  the  furious  pirates  who  had  thus  been \nbalked  of  their  prey.",
