        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The  Emperor  Charles  V.  was  roused  to  action, \nstung  by  the  intolerable  humiliation  of  the  posi- \ntion into  which  he  had  been  placed  by  a  mere \ncorsair.",
