        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "For  many  years  after  his  death  no  Turkish  ship \never  left  the  Golden  Horn  without  her  crew  re- \npeating a  prayer  and  firing  a  salute  over  the  tomb \nof  Beshiktsah,  where  lie  the  bones  of  the  first  and \ngreatest  of  Turkish  admirals,  the  corsair  who  was  at \none  and  the  same  time  admiral,  pirate,  and  king.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
