        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The  practical  retirement  of  Barbarossa  from  that \nsphere  of  activity  in  which  his  life  had  been  passed \nnow  left  Dragut-Reis  the  most  feared  and  the  most \nformidable  of  all  the  Moslem  corsairs  in  the  Mediter- \nranean. From  the  time  of  his  release  by  Barbarossa \nuntil  the  day  of  his  death  at  the  siege  of  Malta  in \n1565,  he  followed  the  example  shown  him  by  that \nprince  among  pirates  with  so  much  assiduity  as  to \nrender  him  only  second  to  Kheyr-ed-Din  in  the \ndetestation  in  which  he  was  held.  Says  Morgan  :",
