        "evidence_excerpt": "\"  Allah !  Allah !  \"  and  \"  Dragut  1  Dragut ! \"  pealed \nthe  war-cry  of  the  corsairs ;  foot  by  foot  and  yard \nby  yard  that  spearhead  of  dauntless  dare-devils \npressed  onwards  into  the  packed  masses  of  the \n\"  Africans,\"  who,  fighting  stubbornly,  nevertheless \nwere  borne  back  by  the  fury  of  the  terrible  on- \nslaught.",
