        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "down  the  tideless  sea  in  the  summer  of  1549  did \nthe  great  Genoese  seaman  range  in  search  of  the \nbold  corsair.  Doria  was  getting  a  very  old  man  now, \nbut  his  eye  was  undimmed,  his  strength  yet  tireless, \nhis  vigilance  and  zeal  in  the  service  of  his  master \nunabated.",
