      {
        "finding_id": "section-864e76e946417b56092c",
        "file": "seawolvesofmedit00curruoft_seawolvesofmedit00curruoft_djvu.txt",
        "title": "Sea-wolves of the Mediterranean : the grand period of the Moslem corsairs",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/seawolvesofmedit00curruoft",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Currey, Edward Hamilton",
          "date": [
            "1913-01-01T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "8ded5d2596f6b8b5da24b9515a2ae1cca80e39c88e17cfd932f28761d003774e",
        "evidence_excerpt": "their  abiding  place ;  from  Malta  they  had  never \nceased  their  warfare  against  the  corsairs,  and  in- \ncidentally against  the  Sultan  and  his  subjects. \nTherefore,  in  this  year  1551,  Soliman  ordained \nthat  an  expedition  should  be  prepared  with  the \nobject  of  crushing  once  and  for  all  these  troublers \nof  the  peace  of  Islam.  The  preparations  were  on \nso  large  a  scale  that  very  soon  it  became  noised \nabroad  in  Europe  that  something  really  serious  was \nin  the  wind :  in  Constantinople,  however,  men \nkept  their  own  counsel ;  it  was  ill  talking  of  the \naffairs  of  the  Padishah,  and,  further  than  that, \nbeyond  Dragut  and  the  proposed  leaders  of  the \nexpedition,  the  Sultan  took  no  one  into  his  con- \nfidence. Charles  V.,  well  served  as  he  was  by  his \nspies,  was  as  much  in  the  dark  as  to  the  destination \nof  this  new  armada  as  were  humbler  folk ;  in  it  he \nrecognised  the  hand  of  Dragut  again,  and  Doria \nhad  standing  orders  to  catch  that  mischievous \nperson  if  he  could.  At  present,  however,  there  was \nno  chance  of  so  desirable  a  thing  happening,  as \nDragut  was  superintending  the  fitting  out  of  the \nnew  expedition  at  Constantinople.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "EXPLICIT_PARAGRAPH",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/seawolvesofmedit00curruoft",
          "source_file": "seawolvesofmedit00curruoft_seawolvesofmedit00curruoft_djvu.txt",
