      {
        "finding_id": "section-0ca74446303f6336e53d",
        "file": "the-regency-of-algiers_The_Regency_of_Algiers_djvu.txt",
        "title": "The Regency Of Algiers",
        "url": "https://archive.org/details/the-regency-of-algiers",
        "source_bibliography": {
          "creator": "Thomas J. Bryan, Claude/Anthropic",
          "date": [
            "2026-09-16T00:00:00Z"
          ],
          "source_type": null,
          "evidence_level": null,
          "rights": null
        },
        "source_text_sha256": "6138c424ee238e85fb6fb48ba525f1c29c7f976cf104138f88baec22a14297cd",
        "evidence_excerpt": "A tribal prince of the plain was a protector against tribes; he was no protector \nagainst a fleet. So the town paid a second time, and to the fleet. The same page of \nHaedo records that Algiers \"sometieron a la obediencia del Rey Catolico, haziendo con \nel tregua por diez afios, y obligandose a pagar cada afio su tributo\" — submitted to the \nobedience of the Catholic King, making a truce with him for ten years and binding \nitself to pay its tribute every year. Ferdinand did not trust a truce with a corsair port, \nand took his security in stone: on the islet that sat so close to the town he had a fort \nbuilt, \"en el qual tenia de ordinario dozientos soldados de guarnicio[n] con su \nCapitan,\" in which he kept an ordinary garrison of two hundred soldiers with their \ncaptain, well supplied with munitions, provisions and artillery. And the fort worked. \n\"Con este fuerte quedaron los de Argel muy enfrenados, sin osar andar en corso, ni \nmenos reuelarse al Rey Catolico, hasta que muriendo el dicho Rey en el mes de Enero, \nen el afio 1516\" — with this fort the people of Algiers were kept well bridled, not \ndaring to go out corsairing, still less to rebel against the Catholic King, until the said \nKing died in the month of January 1516.",
        "years_in_scope": [],
        "date_basis": "EXPLICIT_PARAGRAPH",
        "date_evidence": null,
        "matched_names": [],
        "name_basis": "THEMATIC_CONCEPT",
        "locator": {
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/the-regency-of-algiers",
