        "evidence_excerpt": "desperate people, outlaws and fugitives from justice, drawn by the report that men no \nbetter than themselves had risen to the highest posts; and the Turks of the Levant \nthemselves, it adds, despised the Algerines as a gang of pirates. That is the tribute- \npaying consulates speaking, and it should be heard as such.",
