        "source_text_sha256": "6138c424ee238e85fb6fb48ba525f1c29c7f976cf104138f88baec22a14297cd",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The fourth is the direction of the whole flow. By 1822 the order paid its soldiers \nmore than it received, lived on a hoard built by the corsairs, and sent nearly a million \ndollars a year in gold and silver out of the country to pay for imports. An order whose \nrevenue has come to rest on tribute that the strongest navies had stopped paying, on",
        "years_in_scope": [],
