        "source_text_sha256": "6138c424ee238e85fb6fb48ba525f1c29c7f976cf104138f88baec22a14297cd",
        "evidence_excerpt": "The first recorded movement came from a fight between two armed corporations. \nHaedo says that for many years no corsair or renegade could be a janissary, and the \ncorsairs would not let janissaries sail with them, until the governor Mehmed Pasha \nsettled the enmity between them: janissaries might sail aboard the corsairs' ships as \nsoldiers, and \"todo cosario, o renegado quando quisiesse pudiesse entrar en el numero\"",
        "years_in_scope": [],
