        "evidence_excerpt": "The founding itself was the work of hired captains who killed their employer and \nborrowed an Ottoman warrant. The joining of the corps and the corsairs in the 1560s \nwas a peace between two armed corporations, paid for by opening each one's income to \nthe other.",
